### Academic Task Manager & Backup Circuit REST Tests
### Pre-configured for VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)
### SECURITY PROTOCOL: All secrets must be loaded from local environment. Zero hardcoded secrets.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@authToken = {{$dotenv AUTH_BEARER_TOKEN}}
@dateStr = 2026-10-24

### 1. Health & Server Status Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. LeetCode Target & Daily Progress Snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leetcode/daily-progress?date={{dateStr}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Student Submissions & Task Verification Listing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Tasks Summary & Distribution
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Automated Database & Report Backup Trigger
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/trigger-backup
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_date": "{{dateStr}}",
  "export_tasks": true,
  "export_leetcode": true
}
